{
  "name": "WA Inbound → Golang",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-comment-contract",
      "name": "CONTRACT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Kontrak POST /api/message\n\nWorkflow ini hanya meneruskan (forward) — tidak ada logika parse di sini.\n\n**Request body yang dikirim ke Golang:**\n```json\n{\n  \"phone\": \"<nomor dari WA Business API>\",\n  \"message\": \"<teks mentah apa adanya>\",\n  \"received_at\": \"<RFC3339 dari event timestamp, BUKAN Date.now()>\"\n}\n```\n\n**Idempotency:** `received_at` harus stabil antar retry.\nGunakan `messages[0].timestamp` dari webhook event — jangan generate ulang.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-comment-response",
      "name": "RESPONSE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [900, 80],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Response envelope dari Golang\n\nSelalu baca field `reply_text` untuk pesan yang diteruskan ke user.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"reply_type\": \"confirm|clarify|info|error\",\n  \"persisted\": true|false,\n  \"reply_text\": \"<pesan untuk user — selalu non-kosong>\"\n}\n```\n\n`reply_type` tidak perlu di-switch; cukup teruskan `reply_text`.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 340
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-webhook",
      "name": "WhatsApp Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "wa-inbound",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": "firstEntryJson"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-guard",
      "name": "Has Messages?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ ($json.body.entry && $json.body.entry[0] && $json.body.entry[0].changes && $json.body.entry[0].changes[0] && $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value && $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages) ? 'yes' : 'no' }}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": "yes"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-extract",
      "name": "Extract Phone + Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages[0].from }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages[0].text.body }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "received_at",
              "value": "={{ new Date(parseInt($json.body.entry[0].changes[0].value.messages[0].timestamp) * 1000).toISOString() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-post",
      "name": "POST ke Golang /api/message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [900, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8080/api/message",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "phone", "value": "={{ $json.phone }}" },
            { "name": "message", "value": "={{ $json.message }}" },
            { "name": "received_at", "value": "={{ $json.received_at }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-reply",
      "name": "Kirim Reply ke WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1120, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v19.0/{{ $vars.WA_PHONE_NUMBER_ID }}/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $vars.WA_API_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "messaging_product", "value": "whatsapp" },
            { "name": "to", "value": "={{ $('Extract Phone + Message').item.json.phone }}" },
            { "name": "type", "value": "text" },
            { "name": "text", "value": "={{ JSON.stringify({ body: $json.reply_text }) }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "WhatsApp Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Has Messages?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Has Messages?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Extract Phone + Message", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Extract Phone + Message": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "POST ke Golang /api/message", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "POST ke Golang /api/message": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Kirim Reply ke WhatsApp", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": []
}
